{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"a9ebc320","metadata":{},"source":["# EuroSAT Satellite Image Classification\n","## Course-Level Capstone Version\n","\n","**Student:** Jianye Chen  \n","**Dataset:** EuroSAT  \n","**Framework:** PyTorch\n","\n","This version intentionally uses methods that are close to the course notebooks.\n","\n","Main tasks:\n","\n","1. Load and explore EuroSAT\n","2. Split data into training, validation, and test sets\n","3. Apply simple data augmentation\n","4. Build a custom CNN\n","5. Train with validation and early stopping\n","6. Compare three hyperparameter settings\n","7. Evaluate with accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, and a confusion matrix\n","8. Compare the custom CNN with ResNet18 transfer learning"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"7bb8d9bf","metadata":{},"source":["## 1. Import Libraries\n","\n","The code uses standard PyTorch, Torchvision, Matplotlib, Pandas, and Scikit-learn."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"d748e151","metadata":{},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["PyTorch version: 2.11.0+cu128\n","CUDA available: True\n"]}],"source":["import random\n","import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","\n","import torch\n","import torch.nn as nn\n","import torch.nn.functional as F\n","import torch.optim as optim\n","\n","from torch.utils.data import DataLoader, Subset\n","from torchvision import datasets, transforms, models\n","\n","from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","from sklearn.metrics import (\n","    accuracy_score,\n","    precision_score,\n","    recall_score,\n","    f1_score,\n","    ConfusionMatrixDisplay\n",")\n","\n","print(\"PyTorch version:\", torch.__version__)\n","print(\"CUDA available:\", torch.cuda.is_available())"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cd1b0e1b","metadata":{},"source":["## 2. Basic Settings\n","\n","The first test can use the epoch values below.  \n","If everything runs correctly, the epoch numbers can be increased for the final submission."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"id":"8e321157","metadata":{},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Device: cuda\n"]}],"source":["random_seed = 42\n","random.seed(random_seed)\n","np.random.seed(random_seed)\n","torch.manual_seed(random_seed)\n","\n","device = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"cpu\")\n","\n","DATA_DIR = \"./data\"\n","IMAGE_SIZE = 64\n","\n","TUNING_EPOCHS = 4\n","FINAL_EPOCHS = 15\n","RESNET_EPOCHS = 6\n","PATIENCE = 3\n","\n","print(\"Device:\", device)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"99bf6e21","metadata":{},"source":["## 3. Data Augmentation and Normalization\n","\n","The training transform follows the same simple idea used in the course transfer-learning example:\n","\n","- Random resized crop\n","- Random horizontal flip\n","- Convert to tensor\n","- Normalize\n","\n","Validation and test images are not randomly augmented."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":3,"id":"c675a981","metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["mean = [0.485, 0.456, 0.406]\n","std = [0.229, 0.224, 0.225]\n","\n","train_transform = transforms.Compose([\n","    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(IMAGE_SIZE),\n","    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(),\n","    transforms.ToTensor(),\n","    transforms.Normalize(mean, std)\n","])\n","\n","test_transform = transforms.Compose([\n","    transforms.Resize((IMAGE_SIZE, IMAGE_SIZE)),\n","    transforms.ToTensor(),\n","    transforms.Normalize(mean, std)\n","])"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"e4b4f337","metadata":{},"source":["## 4. Load EuroSAT\n","\n","EuroSAT contains 10 land-use classes. The complete dataset is downloaded using Torchvision."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":4,"id":"4f56bfaf","metadata":{},"outputs":[{"name":"stderr","output_type":"stream","text":["100.0%\n"]},{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Total images: 27000\n","Number of classes: 10\n","['AnnualCrop', 'Forest', 'HerbaceousVegetation', 'Highway', 'Industrial', 'Pasture', 'PermanentCrop', 'Residential', 'River', 'SeaLake']\n"]}],"source":["base_dataset = datasets.EuroSAT(\n","    root=DATA_DIR,\n","    download=True\n",")\n","\n","class_names = base_dataset.classes\n","targets = np.array(base_dataset.targets)\n","indices = np.arange(len(base_dataset))\n","\n","print(\"Total images:\", len(base_dataset))\n","print(\"Number of classes:\", len(class_names))\n","print(class_names)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":5,"id":"8590df31","metadata":{},"outputs":[{"data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x400 with 1 Axes>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"}],"source":["class_counts = np.bincount(targets)\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4))\n","plt.bar(class_names, class_counts)\n","plt.title(\"EuroSAT Class Distribution\")\n","plt.xlabel(\"Class\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Number of Images\")\n","plt.xticks(rotation=45, ha=\"right\")\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"16d31ba4","metadata":{},"source":["## 5. Train / Validation / Test Split\n","\n","The dataset is split into:\n","\n","- 70% training\n","- 15% validation\n","- 15% test\n","\n","A stratified split is used so that each class keeps a similar proportion in each set.\n","The test set is kept separate until the final evaluation."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"id":"e8431904","metadata":{},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Training images: 18900\n","Validation images: 4050\n","Test images: 4050\n"]}],"source":["train_indices, temp_indices = train_test_split(\n","    indices,\n","    test_size=0.30,\n","    random_state=random_seed,\n","    stratify=targets\n",")\n","\n","val_indices, test_indices = train_test_split(\n","    temp_indices,\n","    test_size=0.50,\n","    random_state=random_seed,\n","    stratify=targets[temp_indices]\n",")\n","\n","print(\"Training images:\", len(train_indices))\n","print(\"Validation images:\", len(val_indices))\n","print(\"Test images:\", 